I walk to the small vegetable shop.
This shop is near my flat.
I see the shopkeeper.
He is a very good man.
I wave at him.
He smiles at me.
"Hello," the shopkeeper says.
"Hello," I reply.
There are many vegetables in the shop.
I want tomatoes and onions.
I want this for my sauce.
I like tomatoes very much.
I take five tomatoes.
They are good red tomatoes.
I also want big onions.
I like the taste of onions.
I put those vegetables in a basket.
